        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a7029197-7776-32a9-a339-54e63a4a0e20",
                "word": "никуда",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c443ff2-9641-3b4f-809c-411a81c7f5d1",
                        "entry_id": "a7029197-7776-32a9-a339-54e63a4a0e20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ни в какое место"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "нареч."
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e850162e-3c71-4116-aae8-e31f09247a46",
                                "sense_id": "5c443ff2-9641-3b4f-809c-411a81c7f5d1",
                                "text": "Скорей, скорей в Париж и больше никуда!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61ca8f37-6bfb-4f39-b0e9-3481d444914b",
                                "sense_id": "5c443ff2-9641-3b4f-809c-411a81c7f5d1",
                                "text": "Она шла, как бы не помня себя, не торопясь никуда, бог знает зачем шатаясь в толпе; может быть, она была голодна."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f06620ce-fd95-4d0d-9bb6-d852ed70d66d",
                                "sense_id": "5c443ff2-9641-3b4f-809c-411a81c7f5d1",
                                "text": "С некоторого времени я совсем никуда не хожу, кроме «закусочной» и цирка."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed94077d-ee43-42ec-9285-c6359f701259",
                                "sense_id": "5c443ff2-9641-3b4f-809c-411a81c7f5d1",
                                "text": "― Я, ― говорит, ― никого никуда не веду, всех Господь ведёт!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8e53755-0921-4b39-9caa-253eb7f07aad",
                                "sense_id": "5c443ff2-9641-3b4f-809c-411a81c7f5d1",
                                "text": "В действительности народу было много, работа шла весёлая и живая, и Иван Иванович долго не мог никуда приткнуться."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "97e93f06-c9b5-389f-ab34-9ef1dd26cd29",
                        "entry_id": "a7029197-7776-32a9-a339-54e63a4a0e20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "предик. очень плохо; очень плохой"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cd1f92a-0817-4a08-96ca-41c95e66ab68",
                                "sense_id": "97e93f06-c9b5-389f-ab34-9ef1dd26cd29",
                                "text": "К Карабасу Барабасу подошёл Дуремар; от него, как никогда, пахло тиной. // — Э-хе-хе, — сказал он, собирая всё лицо в кислые морщины, — никуда дела с лечебными пиявками."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2fb32897-2c6c-471a-a7da-dee30c7aeb56",
                        "source_entry_id": "a7029197-7776-32a9-a339-54e63a4a0e20",
                        "source_sense_description": "ни в какое место",
                        "target_lang_word": "nowhere",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nowhere",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ec7bd4f-84eb-3e5d-b78b-32fdf081e6b8",
                                        "entry_id": "d8899560-4520-3042-9880-e56f241721f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In no place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a98db661-ee45-4801-be34-ff6af430e982",
                                                "sense_id": "1ec7bd4f-84eb-3e5d-b78b-32fdf081e6b8",
                                                "text": "Nowhere did the rules say anything about popcorn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "162e1c3d-ae55-456a-acbc-8ab7f5943ef6",
                                                "sense_id": "1ec7bd4f-84eb-3e5d-b78b-32fdf081e6b8",
                                                "text": "The keys are nowhere in the house."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a519134-cb7e-3a25-afcf-056cc09ebef8",
                                        "entry_id": "d8899560-4520-3042-9880-e56f241721f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To no place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8063426-896f-4f06-a925-84064f44a2ba",
                                                "sense_id": "7a519134-cb7e-3a25-afcf-056cc09ebef8",
                                                "text": "We sat in traffic, going nowhere."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nowhere",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b880067e-53b5-34a8-a6aa-0989662c9747",
                                        "entry_id": "ba7f0e81-7af9-3a3f-b182-d0979e862769",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unimportant; unworthy of notice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a38184a-1f70-4ceb-a38c-1ed97f2d6d8f",
                                                "sense_id": "b880067e-53b5-34a8-a6aa-0989662c9747",
                                                "text": "As a foreign stamp gazette it is nowhere. An article on Stamp Collecting, by J. E. Gray, “reprinted from one of his books,” and a catalogue of stamps constitute its sole attraction. We are surprised to find such sounding pretentions so poorly supported."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f55ee2d-c629-4982-8937-c46c14d65c94",
                                                "sense_id": "b880067e-53b5-34a8-a6aa-0989662c9747",
                                                "text": "Elinore was such a bitch, such a nowhere person."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f30e7a0-5e56-4805-8081-44872f29204e",
                                                "sense_id": "b880067e-53b5-34a8-a6aa-0989662c9747",
                                                "text": "He always allowed them to motivate him to a level of intensity to do better, rather than remain in a nowhere life in a nowhere place like Harlem."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nowhere",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ba8aa3d-95ab-3b9f-bf90-1ceda0031fe5",
                                        "entry_id": "8ed3a58d-3eef-3722-b6ed-69e9c14f5e24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "No particular place, noplace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c0a0ef7-f07d-4dd1-925e-592a6640270c",
                                                "sense_id": "3ba8aa3d-95ab-3b9f-bf90-1ceda0031fe5",
                                                "text": "They went on a cruise to nowhere."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a1e1c34-2f8c-4644-9357-ed551e3d6e57",
                                                "sense_id": "3ba8aa3d-95ab-3b9f-bf90-1ceda0031fe5",
                                                "text": "While they paced the platform of the station, they reviewed the career of misdemeanours—Nutley, Chiddiugstone, Midhurst, Penn, and many nowheres, and now Aylesbury."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab793667-3956-47be-b8ef-aa48bacd575a",
                                                "sense_id": "3ba8aa3d-95ab-3b9f-bf90-1ceda0031fe5",
                                                "text": "On a warm summer's evening On a train bound for nowhere I met up with the gambler"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c567363-16cb-43d1-82ab-e478979c26a4",
                                                "sense_id": "3ba8aa3d-95ab-3b9f-bf90-1ceda0031fe5",
                                                "text": "Oh, not the middle of nowhere like the rest of Indiana, but a nowhere so flat and ugly you want to lie down in a ditch and never get up again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c8816ed-4bd7-4da8-b56f-4f49256b1396",
                                                "sense_id": "3ba8aa3d-95ab-3b9f-bf90-1ceda0031fe5",
                                                "text": "But some Nowheres do still exist and are there to be found by any genuinely free spirit willing to hook a caravan behind his four-wheel-drive and dream, say, of finding that isolated campsite beside an as yet undiscovered waterhole"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
